    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632450/extras/ca312f85c46253b5a13688ad32a5826b.poster.avif?t=1697619521\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632450/extras/ca312f85c46253b5a13688ad32a5826b.webm?t=1697619521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632450/extras/ca312f85c46253b5a13688ad32a5826b.mp4?t=1697619521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Destroy whole levels using TNTs and have fun with the destruction physics of Mineblast.<br><br>Mineblast is a platformer game with fully destructible environments. Explore a mysterious mine full of crawly critters and dangers, blast walls to open your way, blast soil and crates to find precious gems, blast wooden platforms to use them as a bridge.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Destructible environments<br></li><li> Retro pixel art graphics and chiptune music<br></li><li> Hidden secrets<br></li><li> Hours of fun!</li></ul>",
